#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:31
msgid ""
"**Recovery:** Automatic. Fix the underlying host issue and the node will "
"rejoin on reboot."
msgstr ""
"**Recuperación:** Automático. Fix el underlying host problema y el nodo "
"será rejoin en reboot."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:33
msgid ""
"If the host remains Offline (Unclean) or fenced, use the evidence, "
"isolation, reboot, and validation workflow in :doc:`troubleshooting`. Do "
"not use Pacemaker cleanup commands on layouts 1.3 or 2.0."
msgstr ""
"Si el host permanece Offline (Unclean) o fenced, utilice el flujo de "
"trabajo de evidencia, aislamiento, reinicio y validación en "
":doc:`troubleshooting`. No utilice comandos de limpieza de Pacemaker en "
"layouts 1.3 o 2.0."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:36
msgid "Scenario 2: Storage Partition (APD)"
msgstr "Scenario 2: Almacenamiento Partition (APD)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:38
msgid ""
"A host loses all paths to shared storage while remaining network-"
"reachable to other cluster nodes."
msgstr ""
"Un host loses todos paths a shared storage mientras remaining network-"
"reachable a otro cluster nodos."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:50
msgid "Storage paths fail, heartbeat writes begin failing"
msgstr "Almacenamiento paths fail, heartbeat writes begin failing"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:51
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:53
msgid "~T+2min"
msgstr "~T+2min"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:52
msgid "6 consecutive failed heartbeat write cycles"
msgstr "6 consecutive falló heartbeat write cycles"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:54
msgid ""
"APD protection activates: all non-pinned VMs on shared storage are shut "
"down"
msgstr ""
"APD protection activates: todos non-pinned VMs en shared storage son shut"
" down"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:56
msgid ""
"**Recovery:** Restore storage connectivity to the affected host, then "
"restart VMs. Investigate the root cause of the storage path failure."
msgstr ""
"**Recuperación:** Restore storage connectivity al affected host, entonces"
" reiniciar VMs. Investigate el root cause del storage ruta fallo."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:59
msgid "Scenario 3: Network Partition"
msgstr "Scenario 3: Red Partition"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:61
msgid ""
"A network failure splits the cluster into two groups that cannot "
"communicate with each other."
msgstr ""
"Un network fallo splits el cluster en two groups ese cannot communicate "
"con cada otro."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:73
msgid "Network partition occurs"
msgstr "Red partition occurs"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:75
msgid "Nodes on each side detect unreachable peers"
msgstr "Nodes en cada side detect unreachable peers"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:77
msgid "Majority side: retains quorum, continues operations"
msgstr "Majority side: retains quorum, continues operaciones"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:79
msgid "Minority side: loses quorum, self-fences"
msgstr "Minority side: loses quorum, self-fences"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:80
msgid "Recovery"
msgstr "Recovery"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:81
msgid "When network is restored, fenced nodes reboot and rejoin"
msgstr "Cuando network es restored, fenced nodos reboot y rejoin"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:83
msgid ""
"**Recovery:** Fix the network issue. Fenced hosts will automatically "
"recover via reboot."
msgstr ""
"**Recuperación:** Fix el network problema. Fenced hosts será "
"automáticamente recover via reboot."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:86
msgid "Scenario 4: Stretch Cluster Site Failure"
msgstr "Scenario 4: Stretch Clúster Site Fallo"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:88
msgid "An entire site becomes unavailable in a stretch cluster configuration."
msgstr "Un entire site becomes unavailable en un stretch cluster configuración."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:100
msgid "All nodes at one site become unreachable"
msgstr "Todos nodos en one site become unreachable"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:102
msgid "Site failure detected (all non-witness nodes at site unreachable)"
msgstr "Site fallo detectado (todos non-witness nodos en site unreachable)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:104
msgid "Surviving site checks witness reachability"
msgstr "Surviving site checks witness reachability"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:106
msgid "Arbitration: alphabetically first site name wins"
msgstr "Arbitration: alphabetically primero site nombre wins"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:108
msgid "Winner adjusts Corosync votes, issues ``fence_ack``"
msgstr "Winner adjusts Corosync votes, problemas ``fence_ack``"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:110
msgid "Loser self-fences (stops DLM, Corosync)"
msgstr "Loser self-fences (detiene DLM, Corosync)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:112
msgid "VM failover begins for VMs from the failed site"
msgstr "VM conmutación por error begins para VMs desde el falló site"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:114
msgid ""
"**Recovery:** Automatic. After the failed site is restored, 3 consecutive"
" healthy cycles (~3 minutes) must pass. Votes are restored, fenced nodes "
"reboot and rejoin. Redistribute VMs across sites after recovery."
msgstr ""
"**Recuperación:** Automático. Después de el falló site es restored, 3 "
"consecutive saludable cycles (~3 minutes) debe pass. Votes son restored, "
"fenced nodos reboot y rejoin. Redistribute VMs a través de sites después "
"de recuperación."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:117
msgid "Two-Node Cluster Failures"
msgstr "Fallos de clúster de dos nodos"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:119
msgid ""
"A two-Host GFS2 cluster uses a Distributed Worker witness as its third "
"quorum vote. Majority is 2 of 3. Do not apply stretch alphabetical site-"
"winner logic to these failures. See :doc:`two_node_clusters` for the "
"complete matrix, assignment order, and Worker URL checks."
msgstr ""
"Un clúster GFS2 de dos Hosts usa un testigo Distributed Worker como su "
"tercer voto de quórum. La mayoría es 2 de 3. No aplique la lógica de "
"sitio ganador alfabético del stretch a estos fallos. Consulte "
":doc:`two_node_clusters` para la matriz completa, el orden de asignación"
" y las verificaciones de la Worker URL."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:122
msgid "One Host Down, Witness Reachable"
msgstr "Un Host caído, testigo accesible"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:131
msgid "One Host becomes unreachable"
msgstr "Un Host se vuelve inaccesible"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:133
msgid ""
"Surviving Host marks the peer unreachable and retains 2 of 3 votes with "
"the witness"
msgstr ""
"El Host superviviente marca al par como inaccesible y conserva 2 de 3 "
"votos junto con el testigo"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:135
msgid ""
"Heartbeat failure threshold; eligible VMs can recover on the surviving "
"Host"
msgstr ""
"Umbral de fallo de heartbeat; las VMs elegibles pueden recuperarse en el"
" Host superviviente"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:137
msgid ""
"**Recovery:** Restore the failed Host. It rejoins Agent quorum when "
"reachable again."
msgstr ""
"**Recuperación:** Restaure el Host fallido. Se reincorpora al quórum "
"del Agent cuando vuelve a ser accesible."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:140
msgid "Witness Down, Both Hosts Reachable"
msgstr "Testigo caído, ambos Hosts accesibles"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:149
msgid "Witness becomes unreachable"
msgstr "El testigo se vuelve inaccesible"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:151
msgid "Both Hosts retain 2 of 3 votes"
msgstr "Ambos Hosts conservan 2 de 3 votos"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:152
msgid "Until restored"
msgstr "Hasta que se restaure"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:153
msgid "The cluster has no Host-failure tolerance; do not take a Host offline"
msgstr ""
"El clúster no tiene tolerancia a fallos de Host; no ponga ningún Host "
"fuera de línea"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:155
msgid "**Recovery:** Restore witness service before any Host maintenance."
msgstr ""
"**Recuperación:** Restaure el servicio de testigo antes de cualquier "
"mantenimiento de Host."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:158
msgid "One Host and Witness Down"
msgstr "Un Host y el testigo caídos"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:167
msgid "One Host and the witness become unreachable"
msgstr "Un Host y el testigo se vuelven inaccesibles"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:169
msgid "Remaining Host has 1 of 3 votes and cannot retain quorum"
msgstr "El Host restante tiene 1 de 3 votos y no puede conservar el quórum"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:171
msgid "Remaining Host fences to protect GFS2"
msgstr "El Host restante se aísla (fencing) para proteger GFS2"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:173
msgid ""
"**Recovery:** Restore either the witness or the failed Host so the "
"surviving Host can form 2 of 3 votes. Do not issue manual fence "
"acknowledgements until the unreachable Host is isolated from shared "
"storage."
msgstr ""
"**Recuperación:** Restaure el testigo o el Host fallido para que el "
"Host superviviente pueda formar 2 de 3 votos. No emita confirmaciones "
"manuales de fencing hasta que el Host inaccesible esté aislado del "
"almacenamiento compartido."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:176
msgid "Host-to-Host Partition"
msgstr "Partición Host a Host"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:185
msgid "Hosts cannot reach each other"
msgstr "Los Hosts no pueden comunicarse entre sí"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:187
msgid "The Host that can reach the witness forms 2 of 3 votes"
msgstr "El Host que puede alcanzar al testigo forma 2 de 3 votos"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:189
msgid "The isolated Host cannot retain quorum and fences"
msgstr "El Host aislado no puede conservar el quórum y se aísla (fencing)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/failure_scenarios.rst:191
msgid ""
"**Recovery:** Restore Host-to-Host connectivity. The isolated Host "
"rejoins after fencing recovery. This is not stretch site arbitration."
msgstr ""
"**Recuperación:** Restaure la conectividad Host a Host. El Host aislado "
"se reincorpora tras la recuperación del fencing. Esto no es arbitraje "
"de sitio de stretch."

